      "traits": [
        "mental",
        "visual"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The baby brine shark spins quickly in place, disorienting observers. All creatures within 15 feet must attempt at DC 17 Will Saving Throw save, with the following effects. The baby brine shark can't use disorienting dance again for 1d4 rounds.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Off-Guard for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Slowed 1 for 1 round.</p>",
